"""The six S2 (emergency) P0 cases: PC (Hamza, classic appendicitis), PD (Usman, deterioration), B (ectopic), D (scan did not answer), F (full stomach), G (dehydrated, kidney injury).
Source: walkthrough Part 13 and Part 17; see content/case_seeds.csv for each story. Ages and dates of birth use the 10 October 2026 reference date (ISS-0018)."""
from lib import D, E, H, O, P, R, S, bad, case, debrief, history, person

CASES = {}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- VAR-S2-PC
